---
import SimpleLayout from '../layouts/SimpleLayout.astro';
---

<SimpleLayout
  title="Privacy | Jakub Polec"
  description="Privacy information for jakubpolec.com."
  canonical="https://jakubpolec.com/privacy/"
>
  <main>
    <a href="/">← Back to jakubpolec.com</a>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      This website uses Google Analytics in cookieless mode for limited site-usage measurement. Analytics and advertising
      storage remain denied, advertising signals are disabled, and the tag does not read or write an analytics cookie or
      persistent visitor identifier.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cookieless measurements are sent to Google with the page path but without query strings, URL fragments or the
      referring page. Browser and network metadata may accompany the request. The tag is not loaded when your browser
      sends a Do Not Track signal.
    </p>
    <p>
      Hosting and security providers may process request information needed to deliver and protect the site.
      For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:jakub@quantjourney.cloud">jakub@quantjourney.cloud</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</SimpleLayout>

<style>
  main {
    width: min(720px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  h1 { margin: 44px 0 20px; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4rem); }
  p { color: var(--muted); }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
